  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are conducting an investigation into an alleged illegal wiretapping operation targeting President Prabowo Subianto. As part of the proceedings, four police generals are reportedly facing legal action under electronic information and wiretapping statutes. Police leadership has denied circulating rumors regarding the arrest of former national police chiefs in connection with the case. Meanwhile, the police have requested protection from the Witness and Victim Protection Agency (LPSK) for six witnesses involved in the inquiry. Political figures have publicly urged authorities to conduct a transparent investigation into reports suggesting that other political leaders might be involved. The House of Representatives' Commission III plans to address the scope and details of this security breach during a formal work meeting with the National Police Chief scheduled for next week, reflecting widespread public concern over the potential implications for national stability.",
